PridefulHuntersPlanarRipper: {
}

PristineFury.LegendaryText:
	'''
	'I and many others lost everything in this world's darkest hour.
	I saw a beast descend from the heavens. A hulking cosmic monstrosity that heralded countless angels of death.
	My family was torn from me, my people forsake me. Even our supposed protectors did nothing to aid us.
	And thus I swore to those I lost that I would do what is right, that my blaze's light would dwarf even that of Zeratros' Sun;
	That one day, this cruel world would know nothing less than My perfect fury.'
	'''

